&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: right"&gt;発行価格     96&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: right"&gt;資本組入額    48&lt;/p&gt;
